title: Trade Unions: Organising
subtitle: One investment in one action: organise a branch of the unions.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_union_investments.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.unionInvestmentsAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.union_investments (Z — 0.56, item 4 of 5 X 2026): the union packages of card 5.1 in a card of their own. Since Z — 0.86 the
// unions have no funds: the card only organises a branch, with its purpose and the reach it would reach.
// One package in one action, its R and the month; the card waits two months. Unions stay one organisation, as in 5.1.
PolishParty.unionInvestmentsView(Q);
!}

= Trade unions: organising

PPS has [+ pl_org_cash +] R. [+ pl_uni_bonus +] Choose one branch to organise; it costs this month's action, and the card waits two months before it comes back.

- @union_organize_industry
- @union_organize_rail
- @union_organize_farm_labour
- @easy_discard

@union_organize_industry
title: Organise the industrial branch
subtitle: [+ pl_uni_union_organize_industry_line +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.selectionStatus(Q, ['union_organize_industry'], 'party.union_investments').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_uni_union_organize_industry_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, ['union_organize_industry'], 'party.union_investments');
!}
go-to: result

@union_organize_rail
title: Organise the railway branch
subtitle: [+ pl_uni_union_organize_rail_line +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.selectionStatus(Q, ['union_organize_rail'], 'party.union_investments').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_uni_union_organize_rail_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, ['union_organize_rail'], 'party.union_investments');
!}
go-to: result

@union_organize_farm_labour
title: Organise agricultural labour
subtitle: [+ pl_uni_union_organize_farm_labour_line +]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.selectionStatus(Q, ['union_organize_farm_labour'], 'party.union_investments').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_uni_union_organize_farm_labour_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, ['union_organize_farm_labour'], 'party.union_investments');
!}
